codex
The existing model has a nonnegative output. Its calculated upper bound is 565, so a gate can suppress the required alerts without changing outputs elsewhere.

A ReLU network cannot represent the strict boundary exactly over all real numbers. I will use a transition of width `2^-54` below 0.5. This distinguishes 0.5 from the next lower value in the supplied Python float format.
